sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK as KFP Python SDK
    participant API as API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP<br/>8887/TCP gRPC
    participant MySQL as MySQL<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow<br/>Controller
    participant Driver as Driver<br/>Init Container
    participant Launcher as Launcher v2<br/>Sidecar
    participant MLMD as ML Metadata<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant Cache as Cache Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over SDK,PA: Flow 1: Pipeline Execution (SDK to Completion)

    SDK->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (TokenReview)
    API->>MySQL: Store pipeline metadata<br/>3306/TCP, Secret credentials
    API->>S3: Store pipeline spec/artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Access key/secret
    API->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow CR<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, ServiceAccount token
    K8s->>Argo: Watch detects new Workflow<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Note over Argo,Launcher: Task Pod Execution
    Argo->>Driver: Schedule init container
    Driver->>K8s: Resolve inputs, compute pod spec<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    Driver-->>Launcher: Execution context prepared

    Launcher->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Access key/secret
    Note over Launcher: Invoke user executor
    Launcher->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Access key/secret
    Launcher->>MLMD: Record artifact/execution metadata<br/>8080/TCP gRPC, No auth

    Note over PA,API: Status Reporting
    PA->>K8s: Watch Workflow status<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
    PA->>API: Report run status/metrics<br/>8888/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Cache,MySQL: Flow 2: Pipeline Caching

    K8s->>Cache: Admission webhook (pod create)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    Cache->>MySQL: Check cache (input fingerprint)<br/>3306/TCP, Secret credentials
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>K8s: Patch pod with cached outputs
    else Cache Miss
        Cache-->>K8s: Allow pod to execute normally
    end
    Cache->>K8s: Update cache entry<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS, SA token
